<title>USA: Yale Int'l FTC waiting period expires.</title>
<headline>Yale Int'l FTC waiting period expires.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLOTTE, N.C. 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yale International Inc said Monday that the U.S. Federal Trade Commission waiting period for its proposed deal with Columbus McKinnon Corp had expired.</p>
<p>With no further anti-trust regulatory requirements to be satisfied, Columbus McKinnon's $24 per share tender offer will proceed until it expires at midnight, October 16, both companies said.</p>
</text>
